{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1464"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge technology/transport","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/technology__transport.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",395],["+"," The 1980s also brought a second line of defence into German cars. General Motors had offered an airbag in the Oldsmobile Toronado in 1973, the first American production car with a passenger airbag; Mercedes-Benz made the Airbag available in the S-Class from 1981. Unlike the belt, it was never made compulsory by law – it became standard because customers and crash tests demanded it."],["=",678]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",387],["+"," Die 1980er-Jahre brachten zudem eine zweite Schutzlinie in deutsche Autos. General Motors hatte 1973 im Oldsmobile Toronado als erstem amerikanischen Serienwagen einen Beifahrer-Airbag angeboten; Mercedes-Benz lieferte den Airbag ab 1981 in der S-Klasse. Anders als der Gurt wurde er nie gesetzlich vorgeschrieben – er setzte sich durch, weil Kunden und Crashtests ihn verlangten."],["=",646]]}]},
